    "detailed_description": "Embark on an epic 2D action adventure in &quot;Fire Path,&quot; a pixel art game that will test your skills and courage through a world taken by cunning enemies ranging from mischievous goblins to haunting ghosts leaving a trail of fire wherever they go.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>* Diverse Enemies: Face a variety of foes, from goblins'n ghosts, each with unique behaviors and challenges. Adapt and strategize to overcome their cunning tricks and relentless pursuit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848160/extras/741931796e42a43fb192eb87bad2ce78.avif?t=1717444560\" width=542 height=304 /></span><br><br>* Atmospheric World: Venture through diverse landscapes, each with its own atmospheric design and enchanting melodies of the game's atmospheric soundtrack, enhancing the overall experience and drawing you deeper into the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848160/extras/ca2d30f390696216cec5c4a76fd8c559.avif?t=1717444560\" width=540 height=302 /></span>",
